  "notes": [
    "The owner can stop a running agent job",
    "A task a module files can carry a rubric, and an issue deliverable is graded from GitHub",
    "The Agents page shows teams and reporting lines; board settings on a team edit the team",
    "Agent teams with kernel task routing, a team day cap and per-agent commit identity",
    "An agent is paused by the owner's lifecycle hold, not Paperclip's status",
    "An agent's state comes from the kernel's jobs, never Paperclip's frozen status",
    "An issue task is done when its issue is resolved, not when a verdict is posted"
  ],
